      "content": "It's a profound and exhausting weight to witness the slow decay of everything you value. Instead of watching it burn, consider what a small, quiet act of defiance could be. You could simply choose to be the one who stops watching, by finding a way to bring the light back to just one small corner of your own life. That small act of choosing to *not* participate in the rot is where the real power lies.",
